  "design": {
    "idea": "ASTONISHING ROOM \u2014 The Three Wicks: maintain all 3 simultaneous Echo Roses across three clock-gated bays (Echo 1 holds West Plate, Echo 2 banks blue bolts through the grate into the Prism Eye, Echo 3 holds the East Topiary Plate) while live Wick enters the Bell-Jar Sanctum for the Boss Key.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Full 3-Echo causal choreography combining clock_gate rotation, blue_transformer bank shots, and Topiary Knight confrontation.",
    "decisions": 11,
    "expert_s": 75,
    "reward": "hg_boss_key+hg_east_shortcut",
    "why": "Signature Island 4 climax puzzle before the final boss; closes Cycle 4 back to the Rotunda.",
